<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!-- Global "API Key rules": two controls inserted inside the native
         "API Keys" setting (Settings > Permissions), right BEFORE the
         "Manage API Keys" button. The whole setting is groups=base.group_system,
         so these inherit admin-only visibility. -->
    <record id="res_config_settings_view_form_apikey_scope" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">res.config.settings.view.form.apikey.scope</field>
        <field name="model">res.config.settings</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="base_setup.res_config_settings_view_form"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//button[@string='Manage API Keys']" position="before">
                <div class="mt16">
                    <label for="apikey_max_group_ids"
                           string="最大權限範圍（預設全帶入）" class="fw-bold"/>
                    <field name="apikey_max_group_ids" widget="many2many_tags"
                           options="{'no_create': True, 'no_quick_create': True}"/>
                    <div class="text-muted">
                        一般使用者建立的 API Key 最多只能含這些存取群組（再與其本身擁有的群組取交集）。留空＝不限制。系統管理員不受此限。
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt16">
                    <label for="apikey_max_duration" string="允許最大時間" class="fw-bold"/>
                    <field name="apikey_max_duration"/>
                    <div class="text-muted">
                        決定一般使用者建立 Key 時可選的最長有效期限與到期日上限；預設「Persistent Key」＝開放全部選項（含永久／自訂日期）。系統管理員不受此限。
                    </div>
                </div>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
